 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "This skateboard",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 0.04,
   "end": 0.87,
   "show": 0.0,
   "hide": 0.89
  },
  {
   "text": "could make you FLY",
   "emph": [
    "fly"
   ],
   "start": 0.93,
   "end": 1.87,
   "show": 0.89,
   "hide": 1.89
  },
  {
   "text": "across a RIVER.",
   "emph": [
    "river"
   ],
   "start": 1.93,
   "end": 2.81,
   "show": 1.89,
   "hide": 3.058
  },
  {
   "text": "You see, ten powerful",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 3.098,
   "end": 4.528,
   "show": 3.058,
   "hide": 4.528
  },
  {
   "text": "electric propellers",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 4.568,
   "end": 5.388,
   "show": 4.528,
   "hide": 5.508
  },
  {
   "text": "blast air downward,",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 5.548,
   "end": 6.648,
   "show": 5.508,
   "hide": 6.808
  },
  {
   "text": "lifting you completely",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 6.848,
   "end": 7.888,
   "show": 6.808,
   "hide": 7.908
  },
  {
   "text": "off the ground.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 7.948,
   "end": 8.548,
   "show": 7.908,
   "hide": 8.716
  },
  {
   "text": "But his first version",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 8.756,
   "end": 9.766,
   "show": 8.716,
   "hide": 9.806
  },
  {
   "text": "used JET ENGINES\u2026",
   "emph": [
    "jet",
    "engines"
   ],
   "start": 9.846,
   "end": 10.906,
   "show": 9.806,
   "hide": 11.124
  },
  {
   "text": "and caught FIRE.",
   "emph": [
    "fire"
   ],
   "start": 11.164,
   "end": 12.184,
   "show": 11.124,
   "hide": 12.354
  },
  {
   "text": "So he switched to electric.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 12.492,
   "end": 13.832,
   "show": 12.452,
   "hide": 14.0
  },
  {
   "text": "Except there\u2019s",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 14.04,
   "end": 14.7,
   "show": 14.0,
   "hide": 14.72
  },
  {
   "text": "one HUGE problem.",
   "emph": [
    "huge"
   ],
   "start": 14.76,
   "end": 16.18,
   "show": 14.72,
   "hide": 16.348
  },
  {
   "text": "The board can\u2019t",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 16.388,
   "end": 17.168,
   "show": 16.348,
   "hide": 17.168
  },
  {
   "text": "balance itself.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 17.208,
   "end": 18.048,
   "show": 17.168,
   "hide": 18.236
  },
  {
   "text": "He has to control it",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 18.276,
   "end": 19.146,
   "show": 18.236,
   "hide": 19.146
  },
  {
   "text": "with his entire BODY,",
   "emph": [
    "body"
   ],
   "start": 19.186,
   "end": 20.326,
   "show": 19.146,
   "hide": 20.506
  },
  {
   "text": "while an AI voice coach",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 20.546,
   "end": 21.726,
   "show": 20.506,
   "hide": 21.726
  },
  {
   "text": "helps him learn",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 21.766,
   "end": 22.286,
   "show": 21.726,
   "hide": 22.286
  },
  {
   "text": "how to balance.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 22.326,
   "end": 22.946,
   "show": 22.286,
   "hide": 23.114
  },
  {
   "text": "And after just over",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 23.154,
   "end": 24.094,
   "show": 23.114,
   "hide": 24.094
  },
  {
   "text": "ten days of practice,",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 24.134,
   "end": 25.234,
   "show": 24.094,
   "hide": 25.424
  },
  {
   "text": "he actually flew",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 25.464,
   "end": 26.354,
   "show": 25.424,
   "hide": 26.354
  },
  {
   "text": "across a RIVER\u2026",
   "emph": [
    "river"
   ],
   "start": 26.394,
   "end": 27.254,
   "show": 26.354,
   "hide": 27.452
  },
  {
   "text": "and THROUGH a CANYON.",
   "emph": [
    "through",
    "canyon"
   ],
   "start": 27.492,
   "end": 28.692,
   "show": 27.452,
   "hide": 28.902
  },
  {
   "text": "How much would someone",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 29.06,
   "end": 29.75,
   "show": 29.02,
   "hide": 29.77
  },
  {
   "text": "have to PAY YOU",
   "emph": [
    "pay",
    "you"
   ],
   "start": 29.81,
   "end": 30.61,
   "show": 29.77,
   "hide": 30.61
  },
  {
   "text": "to ride this thing?",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 30.65,
   "end": 31.43,
   "show": 30.61,
   "hide": 31.78
  }
 ],
